WYOMING BUSINESS COUNCIL
BUSINESS READY COMMUNITY – BUSINESS COMMITTED PROGRAM
$3,000,000 Loan to City of Cheyenne
for Swan Ranch Rail Park Rail Spur Project

Closing May ____, 2014

LIST OF CLOSING DOCUMENTS

1. Appraisal by Hilston Appraisals
2. Entity Documents
a. Granite Peak Development Limited Partnership
i. Certificate of Limited Partnership
ii. Limited Partnership Agreement
iii. Authorizing Resolutions
b. Swan Ranch, LLC
i. Articles of Organization
ii. Operating Agreement
iii. Authorizing Resolutions
c. Clear Creek Land Company, LLC
i. Articles of Organization
ii. Operating Agreement
iii. Authorizing Resolutions
d. CLH, LLC
i. Articles of Organization
ii. Operating Agreement
iii. Authorizing Resolutions
City to Granite Loan Documents
3. Amended and Restated Development and Administration Agreement
a. already executed
b. need copy of City’s authorizing resolution for Contract #6145
4. Non-Negotiable Promissory Note
a. already executed by Granite and City
5. Assignment of Ownership of Rails Etc.
a. already executed by Granite, Swan, Clear Creek, and City
b. Notary paragraphs need to correctly identify the signatories
6. Rail Road Right of Way Easement
a. already executed
b. three-part corridor descriptions to be attached as Exhibit A
c. needs proper signature lines and acknowledgements
d. to be notarized
e. to be recorded
7. Track Lease Agreement
a. already executed
b. to be notarized
c. to be recorded
```

